<title>UK: North.Electric wins one mln stg B.Gas deal.</title>
<headline>North.Electric wins one mln stg B.Gas deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Electric said on Tuesday that its metering subsidiary had won a one million stg deal for reading meters for British Gas Transco's customers.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Northern Metering Services Ltd (NMSL) will read meters of over 11,000 primarily commercial and industrial sites within Northern Electric's area and in neighbouring parts of Cumbria, it said.</p>
<p>The two-year agreement would take effect on February 1, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom  +44 171 542 7717</p>
